%% Figures: a raster/SVG image embedded as a self-contained data URI.
%%   lmr2svg examples/figures/deck.lmr -o figures.html
!title Figures

!slide An embedded figure

!img A tiny factor graph ^fg
	!src figs/diagram.svg
	!caption Two variables and one factor. Embedded as a data URI.
	!width 55%

Images are embedded, so the output stays one self-contained file. Use
`lmr2svg --separate-images` to ship them alongside instead.
